        "content": "<p>pchickey opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14819\">PR #14819</a> from <code>pchickey:fixes-48.0.7</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:release-48.0.0</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>wasi-http: Guests can add conflicting content lengths to messages<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-r8xh-cgf7-392j\">GHSA-r8xh-cgf7-392j</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>wasi-http p3: forwarded trailers aren't checked against <code>is_forbidden_header</code> hook<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-jxcf-8qw5-5c33\">GHSA-jxcf-8qw5-5c33</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>wasi-http p3: Guests can set incorrect content-length for spliced response bodies<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-9prg-84vf-g5fc\">GHSA-9prg-84vf-g5fc</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cranelift backend on aarch64 can jump to incorrect target on large Wasm <code>br_table</code> instruction<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-mghf-wjfp-p5xm\">GHSA-mghf-wjfp-p5xm</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update rustls to 0.23.46<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14768\">#14768</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Panic lowering a host-created component model stream into a guest that expects a different payload type.<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-9pvw-hwfg-92h5\">GHSA-9pvw-hwfg-92h5</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
